/-!
# Fixed P506/L0 form-native constitutive first-jet compatibility

The live-coframe constitutive successor is generated by the existing
action-owned inverse, not by its residual.  This module compares that
operator with the earlier canonical action write at the fixed P506/L0
contact.  The coframe has zero first jet there, so the live and frozen
constitutive inputs have the same tangent; the faithful action inverse then
returns the same generated auxiliary first jet.

Only after this positive operator comparison may the P286 connection
residual be re-read on the new common actual.
-/

